			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Tama Setup — run this once per device.

Open http://YOUR-MAC:8080/pair?token=ADMIN_TOKEN on the machine running
tama-server, then scan the QR code it shows. This redeems the one-time
pairing code for a device token and writes it to iCloud Drive/Shortcuts/tama.json,
where the Tama Capture shortcut reads it.</string>
